msgid "Using your Java skills to write plugins"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Using shell scripts or arbitrary binaries (written in any language) is one "
"of writing plugins.\n"
"Java developers can alternatively put their java skills to use.\n"
"Any source file that contains a main or any jar that defines a main class "
"can be used directly by passing their location (Path or URL).\n"
"In case of jars maven coordinates in the form of GACTV (<Group ID>:<Artifact "
"Id>:<Classifier>:<Type>:<Version>) are also supported."
