msgid "Extension provided plugins"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A Quarkus extension may contribute to the CLI plugins that are available to "
"a project.\n"
"At the moment the following Quarkiverse extensions provide plugins:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-authzed-client[Quarkus Authzed "
"Client]"
msgstr ""

