"Let's see how things work when such an extension is added to a project.\n"
"The following command adds the https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-"
"helm[Quarkus Helm] extension, along with the https://kubernetes."
"io[Kubernetes] and docker extensions that often are used together."
msgstr ""

