msgid "Summarizing plugins"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Quarkus CLI plugin system is not just a way for the Quarkus team to "
"rightsize and modularize the Quarkus CLI, it also offers teams a way of "
"creating\n"
"scripts and recipes specific to their project and distribute them along with "
"the code."
msgstr ""

